\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Oak Depot</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Time\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Time</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Power\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Power</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.2</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Distance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Distance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">12 Studs</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"AOE Distance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">AOE Distance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.25 Studs</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Pickaxe Power\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickaxe Power</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$960</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Pre-release</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Rusty Pickaxe</b> is a pickaxe that new players have to buy in order to progress with the tutorial. It's the worst pickaxe in the game, being also sold on the shelf by the entrance of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p><b>Rusty pickaxe</b> is a short sized pick, showing signs of minor damage. It's headpiece is clearly corroded, using the default legacy rust material. It's handle is covered in old bandages acting as an improvised grip, while being made out of typical brown yellowish wood, using the default legacy wood material.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Initially, player started off with a <a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Axe\" title=\"Wooden Axe\">Wooden Axe</a> and a <a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Putter\" title=\"Rusty Putter\">Rusty Putter</a>. Only after the 1.27.0 update, new players would start with a set of a <a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Axe\" title=\"Rusty Axe\">Rusty Axe</a> and a <a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Saw\" title=\"Rusty Saw\">Rusty Saw</a>, being then directed by the tutorial to buy a <b>Rusty Pickaxe</b> as well.</li>\n<li>In early pre-release, players could buy a <a href=\"/wiki/Stone_Pickaxe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stone Pickaxe\">Stone Pickaxe</a>, alongside other \"starter\" tools. These being: <a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Chisel\" title=\"Wooden Chisel\">Wooden Chisel</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Saw\" title=\"Wooden Saw\">Wooden Saw</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Axe\" title=\"Wooden Axe\">Wooden Axe</a>. Only the latter would ever see the release.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163550\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 82/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 50/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019509/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.728      1 Template:Pickaxe\n100.00%   41.728      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:292-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163550 and revision id 9352. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Tools","Pickaxes"],"links":[{"title":"Rusty Axe","exists":true},{"title":"Rusty Putter","exists":true},{"title":"Rusty Saw","exists":true},{"title":"Stone Pickaxe","exists":true},{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true},{"title":"Wooden Axe","exists":true},{"title":"Wooden Chisel","exists":true},{"title":"Wooden Saw","exists":true}],"images":["Rusty-Pickaxe-UNBOXED.png","Rusty-Pickaxe-BOXED.png"]}
